httpx2 (2.9.1-1~vitex1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New source package: httpx2, Pydantic's actively-developed "v2"
    rewrite of httpx (installs its own top-level httpx2 module, built
    on httpcore2, separate from python3-httpx). Packaged to satisfy
    mcp 2.0.0b2's direct dependency, needed for the mcprack fastmcp
    4.0.0a2 migration.
  * debian/control: rename source/binary package, depend on
    python3-httpcore2 (= 2.9.1), python3-anyio (>= 4.9),
    python3-idna (>= 3.18), python3-truststore (>= 0.10) to match this
    release's actual requirements.
  * Based on the packaging of python3-httpx 0.28.1-1 (Sandro Tosi,
    Debian Python Team), adapted for the separate httpx2 source.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Mon, 27 Jul 2026 17:25:00 +0200
